  "prefLabel": "Pda 308.03 Request for Reconsideration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 308.03 Request for Reconsideration. If a written request submitted pursuant to Pda 308.01 is denied by the authority, the pilot may request the authority to reconsider its decision and may request a hearing. If the pilot includes a request for a hearing in his or her request for reconsideration, the authority shall provide the pilot with a hearing before the board.\n\nSource. #7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
}
